    "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:34:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-05T15:26:45Z",
    "body": "So it only will be really frozen in iOS 26 proper, not in iOS 18 already through further updates, OK. Therefore with existing `iPhone OS 18_6_1` and `iPhone OS 18_6_2`, and in case iOS 18.6.x releases some security patch versions over time, these would continue to follow their implicit `iPhone OS 18_6_3`, `iPhone OS 18_6_4` etc., so such values are still expected too, over time?\n\n(Just figuring out what the expectations should be, if this is documented as a constant of `iPhone OS 18_6`, in case it's only 100% valid for the latest major OS.)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
